e who remains not the same person we  met at the end of loki because as he  explains if you think he's evil wait  till you see his variants so king the  conqueror is being introduced in ant-man  and the wasp quantomania where i assume  they will explore more of the multiverse  and the quantum realm and i think in  this movie we're going to see the  groundwork being laid for secret wars to  actually happen it's already been  happening we literally heard about  incursion and multiverse of madness and  how it's a big big threat universe is  colliding and now we have a villain  coming that wants to rule the entire  multiverse and it's gonna take the  heroes coming together from different  universes to defeat him a multiversal  threat takes a multiversal team let's  just hope that all the stuff that goes  down between them the avengers versus  the x-men gets cleared up so they can  get together to take on kang the  conqueror and in the meantime let me  know what you think about this in the  comments down below would you like to  see an avengers versus the x-men and  other groups movie and let me know how  excited you are for secret wars don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  so you don't miss out on the latest news  for live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof

